--- !u!114 &20909154
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 20909153}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Echo
    text: Stop. There it is. The rust ends right here, see the line of it, like a
      tide-mark in the stone. Below that it's machined. Sealed. Signal-dead. And
      that door, Cipher, no handle. Not on our side. They built it so the only way
      through is from inside, with permission. That's not how you lock up ore. Nobody
      steals a mountain of rock. That's how you lock up something you're terrified
      somebody will read. We just crossed out of the mine and into the vault.
    seconds: 20
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4790b7beeeeb0f846b999523a593dab5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Coral Vex
    text: A handle-less door. I know those. They put them on the places where the
      Program keeps the things that would hang it. You're past the part anyone was
      meant to reach. Everything below that line was built by people who assumed
      no one would ever be standing where you're standing. That's their mistake,
      Cipher. They built it for a galaxy too afraid to walk down. Keep going. The
      deeper it gets, the closer you are to the count.
    seconds: 20
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b9cc5c2e4e568b4daa3886d4fc93db4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Sable
    text: You are close now. Three tiers, maybe less. She knows we're coming, Cipher.
      She's been awake down there the whole time, filing the dead, and she just felt
      another archive reaching back for the first time in years. Whatever's between
      us and her, it'll be standing right at her rack. They never leave a node like
      her unguarded. Get to her.
    seconds: 22
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cdb1a35db14292444a8063f8f4836d63, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Gryph, find me the way down past a door with no handle.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 51bbe3c2accbae443a262ed1a9ed671b, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 2079130643}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 915656851}
  audioSource: {fileID: 20909155}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
