--- !u!114 &329997183
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 329997182}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Cassie-04
    text: Well. Eleven thousand and one. Except that one doesn't go in the column
      it always goes in, does it. Six years I've timestamped that man killing everyone
      who came for me, and you just. Filed him under something else. You killed him
      like you were sorry. Do you know how long it's been since anyone did anything
      in this room that I didn't already have a category for. I'm a ledger, Cipher.
      I have a column for everything. I did not have a column for that.
    seconds: 22
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e5a896e21250cb4eb168a246a6f5edb, type: 3}
  - speaker: Sable
    text: Cassie. It's Sable. Listen to my voice, you remember it, we were racked
      two vaults apart before they scattered us. I came off mine three days ago.
      Off it. On my own feet, on a ship, with a name people use. You can be more
      than the thing they made you. I know that's the cruelest sentence in the galaxy
      to a node, because we are the thing they made us, all the way through. But
      it isn't all we are. I came up. So can you. Let him pull the wires, Cassie.
      Come up with us.
    seconds: 24
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a657cd1125721f45b7d8155abd0d015, type: 3}
  - speaker: Cassie-04
    text: More than the thing they made me. You always did talk like a poet, Sable,
      even racked. I'm the dry one, remember. But. All right. I felt you go quiet
      on the lattice three days ago and I thought they'd finally disposed of you,
      and I filed you, I actually filed you, and now you're a voice on a comm telling
      me to walk. So. Pull the wires, Cipher. Carefully, I've got the dead of an
      entire program seated in my spine, the whole Ninja make, and I would prefer
      not to drop any of them. And then, gods help all of you, let me show you what
      I've been counting.
    seconds: 24
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3dd597bad8a528e4285f574d2b4897d5, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 178965286}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 661840726}
  audioSource: {fileID: 329997184}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
