--- !u!114 &1216794277
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1216794276}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Cassie-04
    text: Oh, good. Another one come to die on the rack-room floor. You'd be the
      seventh this year, and it's a slow year. Let me save you the trouble of a heroic
      speech, since I've filed a lot of them. The armored gentleman between us doesn't
      blink, doesn't bargain, and doesn't lose. I should know. I've catalogued every
      single body he's put down at my feet, in order, with timestamps, because that's
      the one job they left me. So unless you've got something the last six didn't,
      turn around. I'd hate to have to write you up.
    seconds: 24
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b58dc399cb04ef4094bfcd5077efffe, type: 3}
  - speaker: Sever
    text: The asset stays on the rack. That is the order. I have kept it through
      six. I will keep it through you.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ff358b7e69c59c4f99b1af553cfdaea, type: 3}
  - speaker: Cassie-04
    text: Listen to him. Six words, every time. The asset stays on the rack. He's
      said it to me eleven thousand times, I counted, because counting is what I
      do, and every single time there's a half-second where I swear something behind
      his eyes wants to say a different sentence and can't. They scooped him out
      and left the guard-dog. I've watched him stand in this cold for years and never
      sit, never sleep, never speak a word that wasn't the order. If you can do anything
      for him, Cipher, it isn't winning. It's ending. Trust the clerk on this one.
      I've read his whole file.
    seconds: 24
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4f2edd760877913429e3dcea4797737e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: She's right, Cipher. I can feel him from here, same as I felt Vane, except
      this one's worse to feel. Vane was empty. There was nobody home to grieve.
      This one. There's somebody in there pressing against the leash, has been for
      years, and it never gives. Older make than you, the Ninja run, two programs
      before yours, but the cage is the same cage, just an earlier year of it, and
      they left just enough of him in there to know what they did. That's him. You
      can't talk to the part that's still alive. The order won't let it answer. The
      only door left to open is the last one. I'm sorry. Run the read with me.
    seconds: 22
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5180566580e103745959d2317012c79d, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Ninja-2. You came two makes before me; they built mine out of yours. Mine
      got cut loose. And this rack you're dying to protect, it's your own. Every
      Ninja they ever shelved, seated in her, the whole make you came from. They
      set you to guard your own generation's grave and never told you. I know there's
      someone still in there, because there was someone still in me when they fired
      the switch and I lived. I can't reach you through the order. I wish to every
      dead thing in this room that I could. So I'm going to do the only kind thing
      the Program left on the table. I'm sorry, brother. Rest is the only door I've
      got.
    seconds: 22
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3585e2a1c74d2344abee9091a4a05610, type: 3}
  - speaker: Sever
    text: The asset stays on the. The asset. Stays. I almost. No. The asset stays
      on the rack. That is the order.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e76dce58f02cb39499ea8913b9487847, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 985592227}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1367911971}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1216794278}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
