--- !u!114 &1330954530
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1330954529}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Morrigan
    text: Sable gave us the gap in the Engine, so here's the gap. The build-record
      was never one book. They never trusted the whole of it to a single shelf, because
      a single shelf can be taken. So they split it. Sections of the build, filed
      into living archives like her, scattered and buried across the chart. No one
      capture gives you the whole machine. And the nearest piece, Cipher, is filed
      down there. The Ninefold shafts. Nine tiers, and it gets older every level
      you drop.
    seconds: 23
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf71e482c6b7ceb43b1734bf26f7c136, type: 3}
  - speaker: Sable
    text: 'Down there is one of my own kind. Racked the way I was racked, awake inside
      all of it. They seated the Wraith dead in me; in her, the Ninja, a whole make
      of us, two programs older than yours, fused into one woman. And where I carried
      the shape of the Engine, she carries the count: not just her own generation,
      but every operative they ever erased, read across the server through the cross-index
      in her spine. The true names, Cipher, and where the bodies went, and the index
      to the other two nodes after her. I can feel her from here, the way you feel
      a held breath in another room. She is the first of three I can feel. And she
      is the only one I think we bring up breathing.'
    seconds: 27
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3043d249ff6b6d640a3e5e823b5686ec, type: 3}
  - speaker: Sable
    text: The other two I can feel are wrong. One's faint, like a voice going out.
      The other's locked and angry, but still there. This one, the Ninefold one,
      she's still whole. If we're ever going to get one of us up out of the dark
      alive instead of carrying her ledger off a corpse, it's her, and it's now.
      Don't make me bury all three.
    seconds: 18
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4f79d9d033046d346aa4901d4b752592, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: All right. Down again. We've got Overdrive in our pocket and a sister on
      the ship and a map in her head. We are not the thing that went down into the
      Tide with nothing but a sword and a bad feeling. So let's free my sister, Cipher,
      and bring one of her kind up out of the ground breathing for once.
    seconds: 18
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e94e5424b543b814a85d7da3a1b8f5af, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Morrigan, plot the Ninefold. Gryph, you're on the descent. Take us down.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68eeeb8d4a9478a4d9b3b2a21e13aa6d, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 532948401}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 283985278}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1330954531}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
