--- !u!114 &1718707453
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1718707452}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: There it is. The first time your face has been quiet. They held you against
      your own door for years and it took a killing to open it. That's the whole
      evil of them in one man. I'm sorry it was me. Rest, brother. You finally get
      to.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d04637d2a03e234fa52a19def362aaf, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: His shadow's free, Cipher. The leash died with him, same as Vane, and the
      thing they wired behind his eyes just came loose. It's coming to me. I can
      feel it reaching. This one's different, though. Vane gave us time. This one.
      Hold still, let me read what he's carrying. Oh. Oh, that's a good one. He left
      you a step through walls.
    seconds: 16
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c62abe0d752398a429443899d6d621bf, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 152852541}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1330080746}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1718707454}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
